@startuml Blog_CRUD_Sequence
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Admin (Dashboard)" as Admin
participant "Dashboard UI" as UI
participant "API: /api/blog" as API
participant "Prisma Client" as Prisma
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Create Blog Post ==
Admin -> UI : Write Blog Content
Admin -> UI : Click "Publish"
activate UI

UI -> API : POST /api/blog (JSON)
activate API

API -> Prisma : prisma.blogPost.create({ data })
activate Prisma
Prisma -> DB : INSERT INTO "BlogPost" ...
activate DB
DB --> Prisma : { postRecord }
deactivate DB
Prisma --> API : post
deactivate Prisma

API --> UI : 201 Created (post)
UI --> Admin : Update Post List
deactivate API
deactivate UI

== Update Blog Post ==
Admin -> UI : Edit Existing Post
Admin -> UI : Click "Update"
activate UI
UI -> API : PATCH /api/blog/[id]
activate API
API -> Prisma : prisma.blogPost.update({ where: {id}, data })
Prisma --> API : updatedPost
API --> UI : 200 OK
UI --> Admin : Show Success
deactivate API
deactivate UI

@enduml
